    "updated_at": "2016-08-18T21:02:48Z",
    "body": "OK, so WebKit does something reasonable that matches this spec, whereas everyone else deviates from the spec in strange ways. I suspect that at least Chrome's deviations are due to not having a good implementation of the 2147483647 wrapping or of default value fallback on getting.\n\nWe should merge this and then everyone should work to pass the web platform tests that I'm about to send.\n",
